Implemented: I added ''exactly two new files'' with the ratcheted broker/check-seat/install-seat behavior wired to the test signatures, without editing `tools/commit-relay.mjs` or tests:
* `tools/seat-broker.mjs`
* `tools/seat-walls.mjs`

`seat-broker.mjs` now provides `brokerEnv`, hardened pinned-`/usr/bin/git` plumbing, race-safe `readSafe`, receipt-gated `commitWithReceipt` (temp index + `commit-tree` + CAS `update-ref` + real index sync), two-line head-bound `pushWithGo` (go spend-on-attempt), `addWorktree` (`--no-checkout` + archive/tar materialization + gitlink dir preservation + index seeding), and `verifyReceipt` with HMAC timing-safe verification. `seat-walls.mjs` now provides `HAVE_BWRAP`, `signReceipt`, `runCheckSeat` (always walled, no-network, no-home, no-/tmp with tmpfs, receipt only on pass), and `runInstallSeat` (strict `.npmrc` key allowlist, walled offline frozen install, scripts off, poisoned env dropped, `extraRw` + `protect` mount ordering support). ''Unclear items:'' none from the spec provided.

